<h3 nodeId="45ce39bd3d2f468e8c76179abea42e07">一、背景</h3>
<p align="start" nodeId="b0c74139136d47f39e69b56e9d244c41">见画布背景</p>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="f22a7001e2634377bb41e052c8c1afa4">二、名词解释</h3>
<p align="start" nodeId="2ad41adb525f400e9f12209c9a925fcd">Join：<span color=" ">两个流间的数据交叉匹配，满足条件的输出</span></p>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="fb7b21f070cb4f4282e0c7118de9d799">三、操作指南</h3>
